Package: openvpn
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: virtual private network daemon (with Multipath TCP support)
 OpenVPN is an application to securely tunnel IP networks over a
 single UDP or TCP port.
 .
 This build adds the --mptcp option, which opens TCP connections as
 Multipath TCP sockets (Linux kernel >= 5.15 with net.mptcp.enabled=1).
